        "TgtPattern": "(SUM(IF(<x> + <y> IS NOT NULL, <x> * <y>, 0)) - COUNT(IF(<x> + <y> IS NOT NULL, 1, NULL)) * AVG(IF(<x> + <y> IS NOT NULL, <x>, NULL)) * AVG(IF(<x> + <y> IS NOT NULL, <y>, NULL))) / (SUM(IF(<x> + <y> IS NOT NULL, <y> * <y>, 0)) - COUNT(IF(<x> + <y> IS NOT NULL, 1, NULL)) * POW(AVG(IF(<x> + <y> IS NOT NULL, <y>, NULL)), 2))",
